        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Not publicly. Cognition raised the model's ExploitBench score from 11.3 percent to 34.8 percent on purpose, to study and defend against cyber misuse, and states that the weights are not being shared publicly yet. The company says it is building a program to share them securely with trusted industry partners and research labs, with more detail promised in a few weeks from November 4, 2026."
